are underweight.

12
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:31,440
Bangladesh: 23%, Philippines: 21.1%, and Liberia: 19.9%

13
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:32,690
are also high.

14
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:34,790
Japan is a surprise for a wealthy

15
00:00:34,790 --> 00:00:37,340
nation at 11.3%.

16
00:00:37,765 --> 00:00:39,315
At the other end, Sweden is just

17
00:00:39,315 --> 00:00:40,840
4.1%.

18
